5. Distribution Ratios: Use ratios to compare major vs. minor variances, e.g., SCALED_VARIANCE_ALONG_MAJOR_AXIS/SCALED_VARIANCE_ALONG_MINOR_AXIS, SCATTER_RATIO/SCALED_RADIUS_OF_GYRATION.
