tency in elongation vs hollowness across the dataset, aiding in classification.\ndf['ZSCORE_ELONGATION_HOLLOW_RATIO'] = (df['ELONGATION_HOLLOW_RATIO'] - df['ELONGATION_HOLLOW_RATIO'].mean()) / df['ELONGATION_HOLLOW_RATIO'].std()", "# DIFF_MAJOR_MINOR_VARIANCE\n# Difference between SCALED_VARIANCE_ALONG_MAJOR_AXIS and SCALED_VARIANCE_ALONG_MINOR_AXIS to capture spatial asymmetry.\n# Usefulness: Highlights distributional asymmetry critical for distinguishing elongated shapes like buses or compact solid shapes like vans.\ndf['DIFF_MAJOR_MINOR_VARIANCE'] = df['SCALED_VARIANCE_ALONG_MAJOR_AXIS'] - df['SCALED_VARIANCE_ALONG_MINOR_AXIS']", "# BIN_CIRCULARITY\n# Binning CIRCULARITY into quartiles to categorize roundness levels across vehicles.\n# Usefulness: Groups silhouettes with similar roundness properties to simplify classification differences, especially between buses and vans.\ndf['BIN_CIRCULARITY'] = pd.qcut(df['CIRCULARITY'], q=4, labels=False)", "df.drop(columns=['SKEWNESS_ABOUT_MINOR_AXIS', 'KURTOSIS_ABOUT_MINOR_AXIS'], inplace=True)"]
